{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Oh- oh no, no no no NO, that's not- SHIT!!","Sir? Sir, are you okay? Sir, you're- why are you- oh God","No person walks like that, no PERSON!","He's walking wrong, someone should help him, somebody should- no, stay put!","Is he drunk? Please tell me he's drunk...","It looked right at me, right AT me - nobody home in there!","My legs won't go, they just won't GO!","Shhh... don't move, don't move, it hasn't turned yet!","Mrs Calloway? Mrs Calloway, it's Tammy- Mrs Calloway, stop!","I KNOW him, he cuts my hair, why is he- why is his-","No- no, he was fine yesterday, I talked to him, he was FINE!!","Back up! Everyone back UP! It's not stopping!","Why won't it stop? We told it to stop, we TOLD it!","God, the sound it makes... I'm gonna be sick!","Tell me it's a costume, tell me it's a dumb prank, it's JULY!","There's two, no, three, oh Lord there's more behind them...","I yelled at it... I actually yelled at it to go home!","Help that man! He's- he's- never mind, don't!","It's still coming, it's just gonna keep coming","Holy- what is wrong with its face? What's wrong with its FACE?","Nope - nope nope nope, nope, no thank you","I'm not going over there, you go!!","Ohhh no, no, keep it away from me, please!","Wait- wait, he's got a name tag on, he's got a NAME TAG!","Randy? RANDY! Say something, say anything- Randy!!","I checked him myself, he was COLD!","He just stood right UP!","Don't let it touch you, don't let it- Jesus, the way it MOVES-","This isn't happening, this is not happening, I'm asleep, I'm in my bed","Whoa, whoa, WHOA, back off, BACK OFF!","That man's been gone since Tuesday and he's out getting his paper!","Aaaaah! Ahh- ahh- oh no, nonono, get AWAY!","It's still got one shoe on, why is that the thing I'm looking at!","Go home! Go on, shoo, go home!","We don't have anything for you, please!","Someone call 911, somebody just- is the phone even- somebody CALL!!","Okay brain, think, THINK, what do you do about a thing like that","Friday I was at the Dairy Queen, I was just THERE!","You in the red shirt! GET AWAY FROM IT! Lady, don't go near it!!","I used to babysit that girl, I used to babysit her, she's SIX!","I think I wet myself, I'm not even kidding, I think I did...","Nobody told us, why didn't anybody TELL us?","Is that a woman? I can't tell, is that- ma'am? MA'AM?","Brandon, get away from the- BRANDON! Not one more step!","Not one sound from anybody, not one, it's listening...","Mama? Mama, I want Mama, where's Maaama","Oh come on, come ON, I can't take this, not now!","Is it- is that his hand? Why's his hand like that?","Somebody ELSE do it, I can't, I'm not the one","AAAHHH- sorry, sorry, sorry, I'm sorry, I'm just really- AAH","It's got his reading glasses on a string, that's Mr Odom!","It knows my name, it said my- no, that's not- it didn't say anything!","Bobby? Bobby Lee? That's Bobby Lee Sutter, I played ball with him!","Don't scream, don't, don't, if you scream it knows where you are!","What if it's catching? Just from LOOKING at-","Hello? HELLO? Is anybody- anybody else seeing this?","That is no human, whatever you think!","I'm too young for this, I'm twenty-two, I'm too YOUNG for this","Oh, no no no, no, it's the lady from the bank, she's still got her badge","It was so quiet! How do those things do that?!","I'm going to be sick, no, I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm not fine!","A man in a suit, why's it in a suit, who wears a suit to-","We just stand still, that's all - it'll go on by","Oh no, it's coming this way, I think it's coming this way","Hey! HEY! Over here! No, wait, not over here, away, AWAY","God forgive me, I just want it to be somebody else's problem","Hold my hand, please, just hold my hand","I can't look at its face, I can't, but I can't look away either","Jesus Jesus Jesus, help me, I don't know the words, just help me!","Holy- is it dragging something? Don't tell me what it's dragging!","Oh Lord, it's the Whitaker boy, he's in his football pants","Somebody drive, somebody just DRIVE!!","Fine, I'm looking, don't make me look again","I want to wake up, someone please wake me up, hello?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","role=family_youth|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Mom said don't talk to strangers, so what do I do with THAT"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Another one!! Over there, by the pumps!","Oh God, there's another one behind it, why are there so many?","Shit.. shit, SHIT, okay, it's just the one","I thought it was only on TV, just over in Louisville!","Walk, just walk, don't run, I read that running makes them-","It's got a wedding ring on, did you see that? A wedding ring...","Please be somebody's drunk uncle!","Ha- ha, no, no that's not, nobody does that, nobody walks like that","It heard me - I only breathed and it heard me!","Get behind the- get behind something, anything, GO","What do I do? What do I DO? Somebody say what to do!","Oh God, I'm gonna throw up right here","That used to be Pam from the Kroger, I'd know that apron anywhere","It's looking at me like I'm- like I'm something to- oh Jesus!","Close your eyes, close them, everybody close your eyes!","Please don't come this way, please please don't come this way","Easy, easy, nobody scream, nobody make a sound","Slow, go slow, my heart's gonna come right out of my-","Is it a- is this the sickness they said? Is this what it is?","It won't go away, I keep waiting for it to go away!","I'm not looking, I'm looking, oh God!","Where do I run? There's one that way, there's one that way too...","Three days ago I was worried about the electric bill","That smell, oh God, what IS that smeeell","It makes this low noise like it's trying to talk, it can't...","Maybe it's blind, maybe it can't see, maybe if we stay still-","Maybe it's the fever, they said fever, maybe it's just really bad!","It's got a church bulletin sticking out of its pocket, oh God!","Why's everyone just standing there? Why's nobody doing anything?","It walked right through the sprinkler, didn't even care, kept coming!","I keep thinking he'll just- you know- snap out of it","Pastor said the Lord wouldn't give us more than we could take, well","Is it following me? I think it's following me, I think I'm the one!","Run, no, don't run, they chase, walk, WALK, walk fast","It's so quiet and then it moans and I forget how to stand!","That's somebody's mother, that was somebody's mother, I'm sorry!","Slow, back up slow, one foot, one more foot, don't trip!","Why didn't I stay home, why in the world did I come out here?","Oh sweet Jesus, there's a whole bunch down by the Kroger","The one on the left is wearing a Little League jersey","I can hear it breathing, I CAN, it's right there","It's got dirt on its hands, why's there dirt, did it crawl- never mind...","Please let someone come, please, anyone, an Army guy, a cop, anybody","I need to call somebody, anybody, there's a pay phone- no, it's dead too","Look away, don't watch it, I'm telling you, just don't","I can't remember how to work my legs, somebody remind me!","It tried the handle on Mrs Pike's house, it TRIED the handle","Nobody said this on the news, not one word!","It's just a man, it's just a man, it's just a-","It's okay, it's okay, just give it room, give it room!","I should be screaming, why am I not screaming, it's so quiet in my head","There's one at the end of the block and one at the other end","A dog, thank God, just a- no, no, oh no!","Get in front of the little ones, put yourself in front","It's one of them! Don't let it near you!"}},
