{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4",{"Wait, is that- that's Mr Pruitt, why's he not wearing shoes?","I don't like how it's standing, it's too still, it's not right","Hey- hey, mister? You need help, mister? ...mister?","What IS that, somebody tell me what that iiiiis?","I'm not fast enough for this, I'm not, I've never been fast","There's something wrong with that man, like really wrong","It keeps bumping into the same thing, like it can't figure it out","Is it sick? It's sick, it has to be sick, somebody call a doctor","Don't make eye contact, I don't know why, just don't","If we're quiet it might just go by, right? Right?","That woman's not breathing, why's she walking if she's not breathing","Oh my God, a kid, it's a kid, it's a little kid, I can't","That's the paperboy, that's the PAPERBOY","It's not blinking, did you notice it's not blinking?","So that's what they meant, that's what the radio guy meant","I need to sit down, I really need to sit down right now","Wasn't that guy on the news, the one they said was sick?","Please, it's just somebody's grandpa, that's all it is!","Hold on, I just need a second, one second!","Don't let that thing notice you","Quiet! Quiet, quiet! Don't draw it to us!","How many are there? Somebody count, I can't count","Dale, get back here, DALE, don't go up to it","I waved at him, I actually waved, like a moron","It's dragging a foot, why's it dragging a foot, why isn't it hurt?","Slow breaths, it can't smell fear, can it?","Hail Mary, full of- full of- I forget the rest, I forget it all","It's one guy, okay, it's just one guy, we can walk away from this","My hands, look at my hands, I can't make them stop","I'm gonna count to three and then I'm gonna- no, I'm gonna run","What am I supposed to do, wave? Do I wave?","Can it even tell we're here? Can it see us at all?","I'm just gonna close my eyes for a second, just one!","My mouth is so dry, I can't even yell for help","I thought they were hurt, I really thought they were just hurt","Nobody moves until it's gone by, that's what I'm saying, nobody","Close the gate, somebody close the gate, close it NOW!","Dad? Dad, are you seeing this, DAD","What's it want? It's not asking for anything, what does it WANT!","Fine, fine, it's a sickness, people get sick, people stagger","Who's gonna tell his wife? Someone's gotta tell his wife","It's like watching somebody in their sleep, walking around in their sleep!","Count 'em, how many, I count four, no, five, I can't count"}},
