{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"County deputy! Stop right there, sir, STOP!","Sir, I need you to stop walking, sir, SIR!","Ma'am, show me your hands, ma'am, let me see your hands!","Sir, you're not listening, why aren't you listening?","Police! Stop! ...he's not stopping","Sir, I'm trying to help you, let me help you, sir-","Jesus Christ, Pruitt, tell me you see that","Mullins? Mullins, you see him? You see what he's doing?","That's Earl Tucker, I've arrested Earl Tucker six times, that is NOT Earl","I went to school with him","Think, think, there's a procedure, there's gotta be a- no, there isn't!","Don't touch him, don't let him touch you, folks, back away","Get somewhere safer, please, NOW!","That's PCP, that's gotta be PCP, some kind of bad batch","I can't fire on a civilian, I don't care what he looks like...","I can't just shoot a man in his bathrobe, Sarge, I can't","Is he armed? ...he's not even doing anything, he's just walking!","What is it, what IS it, someone tell me what I'm looking at...","Don't shoot, wait, hold on, wait","Mrs Haskins, it's Deputy Hatcher, you KNOW me!","I put his boy through juvenile once, he's gonna- no, he's not gonna do anything","Get on the radio, someone get on the radio and say it, say what it is","It's a person, it is STILL a person, don't forget it's still a person","He's looking at my belt, why's he looking at my belt","That's the second one this hour, the SECOND one, Dispatch is gonna think I'm drunk!","God help us, God help every one of us in this county!","It's got a school ID badge on it, a school ID, God!","Don't cuff him, don't try to cuff him, cuffs won't help","Sir, are you injured? Do you need an ambulance? ...sir?","Hands! Show me your hands! ...he doesn't have any hands I can see, he's just walking"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4",{"That's your last warning, sir, last warning!","State Police! Stop where you are, do not come any closer!","Back up, sir, I'm not going to tell you again","Down on the ground, get down on the ground NOW","My training didn't cover this, nothing covered this","Eyes on me, Mullins, look at me, not at him, at ME","Back up, folks, everybody back up, give me room","Nobody approach him, I said nobody, that includes you, sir","Folks, go home and lock up, go on home","Clear the area, move it","Is it- are they all like that? Are they ALL like that?","Cover the left, nothing gets past on the left","I count five, no, six, hold up, six","Keep it between us, away from the crowd","Slow, slow, it's slow, keep your distance, it can't reach you!","Dispatch, do you have a code for unknown disturbance? Use that one"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","role=law_deputy,law_officer|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Dispatch, Unit 12, I've got a subject, uh, ambulatory, non-responsive","Dispatch, I need EMS on- no, cancel that, don't send EMS","10-33, 10-33, I need backup at- hell, I don't even know where I am!","Dispatch, I don't have a code for this","All units, all units, they're not drunks, repeat, NOT drunks","Come back, Dispatch, send anyone, I don't care who","Hatcher, you take the left, I'll take the, hell, I don't know!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_ZOMBIE","role=law_deputy,law_officer|day=0,4",{"Unit 6 to Dispatch, say again, say again your last","Control, be advised, we've got more than one","Base, this is Four, I've got another one, that's the fourth on my beat"}},
